<title>USA: Hancock PS, Mich., won by Dain Bosworth.</title>
<headline>Hancock PS, Mich., won by Dain Bosworth.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth said it won $8.485 million of Hancock PS, Mich., 1996 school building and site bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.5042 percent.</p>
</text>
